        "id": 229849,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-02-25T13:31:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This was long, but really fun. Bhuta never had any turns that I couldn't deal with, and between Flora, Healing Pollen and Innervation Ray, I never lacked for HP. Omnitron was amazing for helping everyone set up because Thriya needs all the help she can get and both AZ and KNYFE had their good cards buried deep in their decks. If I'd been a little more reckless with the latter, I probably could have shaved a few turns off the overall total, but it was a good time nevertheless.</p>\n<p>Though I seethed inwardly every time Akash'Bhuta took no damage from Ember Dunes. &gt;:B</p>",
